      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/Alicia%2C_Point_Vicente_Lighthouse%2C_Rancho_Palos_Verdes%2C_California_%286026545133%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alicia,_Point_Vicente_Lighthouse,_Rancho_Palos_Verdes,_California_(6026545133).jpg",
